WEBVTT

00:18:24.996 --> 00:18:30.246
and reaches out to touch. But the new
alpha continues to beat him up

00:18:30.704 --> 00:18:33.038
and he beats him up really savagely,

00:18:34.329 --> 00:18:38.079
even though the other one is giving
all the submissive responses.

00:18:38.413 --> 00:18:44.871
And when he's behave that way for about,
let's say, a month or so,

00:18:45.496 --> 00:18:50.579
then suddenly there's, of course, that
the previous alpha is now very, very,

00:18:50.579 --> 00:18:56.079
very nervous and submissive. And then
the alpha changes completely.

00:18:56.496 --> 00:19:01.829
He's always grooming him. It's really
nice to him. He never attacks him.